1
00:00:00,756 --> 00:00:05,626
(Sheldon:)Are you using trains to trick me
into giving you advice?

2
00:00:05,628 --> 00:00:08,258
(Sheldon:)No.

3
00:00:08,264 --> 00:00:10,934
(Sheldon:)All right, then.

4
00:00:10,934 --> 00:00:13,264
(Sheldon:)You should take a third train

5
00:00:13,269 --> 00:00:15,599
(Sheldon:)where you audition
for the movie

6
00:00:15,605 --> 00:00:17,535
(Sheldon:)but hold off
on making a career decision

7
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:19,410
(Sheldon:)until you have more information.

8
00:00:19,409 --> 00:00:21,139
(Penny:)Oh. You're right.

9
00:00:21,144 --> 00:00:23,514
(Penny:)I'm worried about something
that hasn't even happened yet.

10
00:00:23,513 --> 00:00:24,913
(Raj:)Huh.

11
00:00:24,914 --> 00:00:27,684
(Penny:)You are a wise man.

12
00:00:27,684 --> 00:00:29,884
Well, Penny, who's smarter:
the wise man

13
00:00:29,886 --> 00:00:34,056
(Sheldon:)or the person who comes to him
for advice?

14
00:00:35,023 --> 00:00:36,923
(Penny:)Oh, I guess you're right.

15
00:00:36,926 --> 00:00:39,196
(Penny:)Maybe it is the person who asks.

16
00:00:39,195 --> 00:00:41,525
(Sheldon:)No, it's the wise man.

17
00:00:44,933 --> 00:00:48,373
(Sheldon:)That's why he's called
the wise man.

18
00:00:48,371 --> 00:00:50,741
(Sheldon:)You know how I know that?

19
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:53,070
(Sheldon:)I'm the wise man.

20
00:00:54,209 --> 00:00:56,579
(Penny:)I'm sorry. What was I thinking?

21
00:00:56,579 --> 00:00:58,209
(Sheldon:)Uh, just out
of curiosity,

22
00:00:58,214 --> 00:01:00,714
(Sheldon:)why didn't you ask Leonard
for advice about this?
(groans)

